WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:07.180
If you don't follow the agreement,
your entire tribe will pay for it.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:14.600
If I destroy the ship...
I don't have to do anything else?

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.310
Begin warp!

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.320
Age!

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:28.320
I left Age behind again.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:34.620
I let him fight all by himself. And
we call ourselves the royal knights?!

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.380
Therefore, we will stop protecting these planets
that war has brought to the brink of death,

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.800
and instead devote all our forces
to protecting the Argonaut,

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.800
so that you can finish your mission.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:52.260
I will find the path... I promise, Age.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:59.730
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni
ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:06.030
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:26.300
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:32.430
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi
demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.220
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:38.640
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.110
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:45.610
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.360
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.030
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:58.750
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa
tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:03.790
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:12.590
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita
kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.680
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:41.750
How far along is the defensive line?

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.210
Ma'am...

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:46.710
at this point, we've completed 80%.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.630
I believe there's been a slight
delay in relocation of the core.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.300
Make them hurry. The battle is about to start.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.510
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.270
The Tribe of Iron, huh?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.320
Are they trying to let that ship escape?

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.290
I found it.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:23.330
Now you have one more ship to destroy, Mehitak.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:29.500
Go. Refusing is not an option.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:47.480
Presence of Full Hedron detected.
It's the Tribe of Silver!

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:52.150
Pearl Core, maintain the current coordinates.
Have Ruby Core and Topaz Core move to the front.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.200
Maintain fleet activities around Blue Core.

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:19.010
Ruby Core has arrived at minus 240-1 3.
Topaz Core has arrived at 1 3-1 1 -54.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:22.060
Prepare to attack!
 Ready to attack!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.100
Fire.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.040
A very powerful
spatiotemporal distortion detected

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.000
on the periphery of the planetary system.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:53.090
Massive warp out!
The enemy force continues to grow!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:58.140
Azz-Azoth Fleet is suppressing
the enemy's main force for us.

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:01.100
Don't you die, Nilval...

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.400
Receiving data via the psycholine.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.570
It's the princess' guidance.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:18.110
Analyze that and send it to the
navigation map. Infer the route.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:39.300
Karkinos! What's the matter? What are you doing?

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:44.810
lmpossible... For you to be defeated...

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:51.980
Yuty's heart is wavering.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:55.570
If Karkinos continues to fight, he will...

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:59.400
I wonder if that's also a part of the agreement.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:02.320
What is Mehitak doing?

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:08.370
He's crying. I wish I could take his place.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:14.250
This is the destiny of the agreement.
No one can take his place.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:19.800
Just as no one can bear the
burden of your task for you.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:23.390
I want to know...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:29.430
Why did the Tribe of Gold
leave the agreements for us?

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:39.110
What could the agreements and the warring
that control us bring to this universe?

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.280
Karkinos...

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:45.330
You fool... Hurry up and kill him!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.920
Where's the Argonaut?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:57.500
They're behind us at distance 2389.
They're moving at full speed.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:01.090
To think they're moving at
full speed off the starway...

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:04.550
It must be the guidance of that princess.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.850
Enormous energy is approaching at high speed!

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:09.520
It's going to reach this planetary
system within 20 seconds!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:13.230
Pearl Core! Deploy the
generator directly overhead!

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.560
What's the situation on the front line?

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:59.610
A continuing stalemate.
The enemy force is slowly gaining its size.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:09.740
A new object detected in
Ruby Core's line of fire.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.910
From the data we have
on its makeup, it's a Nodos.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.960
Can you put it on the screen?
 Yes, ma'am!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.920
Nodos!

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.000
Pearl Core isn't going to make it!

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:22.880
Concentrate the Dralion Unit there!

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.860
None of the attacks have
any effect on the target!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.900
What did the Nodos do?

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:53.700
It doesn't attack or get attacked.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:57.420
Does it expect us to quietly
let it through because of that?

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.790
Don't mess with us, you monster!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.800
Turn the Pearl Core's generator all the way up!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.800
Synchronize with the planetary magnetic field!

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:07.840
Create a gravitational field and drag that
monster out of its little invisibility cloak!

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:27.320
The light itself is nothing but camouflage.
Nothing can dodge the gravity net!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.030
Squeeze the net!
 Yes ma'am!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:38.920
Synchronization complete!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.960
Beat it up!

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:53.430
Captain, multiple ant heaps are
approaching us from the rear.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:58.350
They're just a group that got separated from the
main force. Get ready to engage. Stay on course.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:04.770
Enormous energy detected from
behind the ant heaps. Distance: 67247.

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:11.820
Is that Age? If so, he's been
fighting at least 200 hours straight.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:17.000
Age...

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:53.510
Coming at you!

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.390
You monster!

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:13.190
Karkinos... I know you can do better than that.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:24.120
That ship is not here.

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.830
Where is it?

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:45.980
High energy emerging around the Nodos!

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.310
It seems that it's in attack mode now.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.770
The monster has awoken, huh?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:54.650
All fleets, spread out! Medic ships and
supply ships stay around the Pearl Core!

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.780
Blue Core, release all the main blums!

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.490
Go full automatic and crush every single ant!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:17.840
Concentrate 80% of the firepower on
the Nodos. Use the rest to go after the ants!

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:22.510
The energy is expanding rapidly! It's
exceeding the limits of the Pearl Core's shield!

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.520
What?
 Hurry up and aim!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:27.060
Aiming at the Nodos! Locked on!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.780
Aim adjustment complete!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.740
Aiming with a margin of error 0.01%!

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:45.790
Fire!

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.100
W-Withdraw!

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:13.770
What?

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.410
What? What just happened?

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:10.000
Massive energy detected on the planet Huelgoat!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:13.040
I can see that much!
What the hell just happened?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:19.300
The planet has... died...

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:39.860
Topaz Core is badly damaged!
Unable to communicate with 60% of the fleet!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.780
Ruby Core and Blue Core
have received extensive damage!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:47.280
Recover Dralion Unit! Move all the
fleets behind the satellite fortress!

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:48.530
Where's Pearl Core?

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:51.250
It's still synchronizing with the enemy Nodos!

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.420
How much time do we have until
the total destruction of the planet?

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.090
Less than 200 seconds.

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:07.100
I'll maintain the
gravitational field until then.

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:11.430
Gather all the fleets, Ruby Core
and Blue Core around the Nodos!

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:14.480
We should drop the synchronization
and release him right now!

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:18.690
If we get hit one more time,
we're all going to die for certain!

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:22.780
So we should let him go and
let the Argonaut be sunk?

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.610
Then what's the point of
all the damage we just took?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.820
What did that planet get blown away for?

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:44.130
I guess I am as useless as
those dead commanders, huh?

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.300
Look what's happening...

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:50.350
I could care less if some fleets ignored
my order and just ran away at this point.

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:57.850
Ruby Core standing by at point N-3.
Pearl Core standing by at point N-83.

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:02.150
Blue Core and each battleship, go to 88-03-33!

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:06.900
Some of the unreachable ships
are joining the fleet activities!

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.990
No one is running away?!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:14.370
I guess it can't be helped.
We're all crazy about you, ma'am.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:20.170
That's how you keep
getting yourselves killed, fools...

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:00.330
Karkinos!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:19.600
Why... Why did the Tribe of Gold
give that Nodos to the Tribe of Iron?

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:26.940
Maybe to divide this universe into two.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.700
Into two?

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:55.680
They're small groups. The Azz-Azoth Fleet
is managing to suppress all the rest of them.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.720
All Organ Units, return to the ship.

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:03.900
The ship will now move to
Space Speed 3 and enter active warp once again.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:06.270
All Organ Units, return to the ship.

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:10.990
Did we find the starway?
No, the princess must be...

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:23.290
I'm putting everyone in danger...

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:26.340
When I think about it, I get scared.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.630
Dhianeila is doing the right thing.

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.630
What?

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:36.970
Because you did what Dad and the others said.

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:39.140
You mean the Tribe of Gold?

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:46.860
Belcross will make a path. So you go
straight down the path you want to take.

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:49.900
If you do that we can meet again.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:54.200
Age...

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:59.490
Transmit our course to the Azz-Azoth Fleet.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:03.330
If the planet Huelgoat was really destroyed,
for them who've lost their starway,

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:07.500
this ship is the only
sign that they can rely on.

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:11.510
Captain, I can sense a source of
strong hostility coming towards us!

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:13.880
Deploy the shield at the maximum output power!

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:17.350
Search for the spatiotemporal and gravitational
disturbances in the surrounding area!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:20.060
Gravity disturbance detected!
It's right above us!

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.770
What?

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.520
Data match!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.360
Th-That's Full Hedron!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.400
The Tribe of Silver?

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:37.910
There you are. Tribe of Iron...
I won't let you get away.

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:51.550
Not enough shield output power
available due to warp standby!

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:55.260
Stopping active warp charge
due to the shield deployment!

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:09.060
The timing couldn't be worse! Damn you...
Shield or warp, which one should we give up?

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:11.570
Take the path that's given to you.

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:13.280
Princess?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.200
Back off!

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:37.050
The attack has stopped!

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:39.720
Emergency shield release! Active warp!

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:51.150
Wh-What was that just now?

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:05.120
Dhianeila-sama!
 Are you all right?

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:06.830
What in the world...

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.630
Dhianeila-sama!

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:20.380
Dhianeila-sama?

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:22.430
Dhianeila-sama!

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:34.230
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:41.910
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:47.240
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:57.800
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:10.520
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:21.820
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:26.870
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:33.580
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:37.210 --> 00:23:41.510
Leaving Age behind alone,
the planet Dewey closes in on us.

00:23:41.590 --> 00:23:45.390
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 9: "The Return."
